# Environment variables this repository actually reads. Names and meanings only --
# never values, tokens, endpoints or credentials, in this file or any other.
#
# Both are OPTIONAL and both have working defaults in the code, so a clean checkout
# needs no .env at all. They are listed here because they are the only environment
# inputs `scripts/` reads that a developer might legitimately want to change.
#
# Verified against the source rather than assumed. Anything not shown below was not
# found being read, and inventing a variable would make this file a work of fiction.

# Seconds to wait for one AXLE kernel call. Default 120.
# Read at scripts/axle_gate.py:67
AXLE_TIMEOUT=

# The Lean environment name AXLE verifies against. Default "lean-4.33.0".
# Read at scripts/axle_gate.py:137
AXLE_ENV=

# NOT a variable this repository defines: AXLE itself is a hosted service and needs no
# credential here. `make test` never contacts it -- that boundary is `-m "not axle"`,
# and reaching the service is the explicit opt-in `make test-axle`.
